<%/* The agent's words while it's still writing them, rendered as markdown as
     they come, so they look as they will once saved: never raw markdown.
     Each push replaces the words so far (#<id>-text) with all of them,
     rendered afresh, since a list or a code block isn't markdown until it's
     whole enough. When the words are done, the saved entry takes this one's
     place, looking the same. `it` has id and html (the words so far,
     rendered). */%>
<li class="entry agent live" id="<%= it.id %>" ko-region><div class="prose" id="<%= it.id %>-text" ko-region><%~ it.html ?? '' %></div></li>
